#
# KeyMint ID attestation was provisioned at the factory with the region
# product name (ro.product.name on stock), which stock init derives from
# ro.boot.carrierid: European sales codes -> q6qxeea, SER/TUR/INS groups ->
# q6qxser/q6qxtur/q6qxins, everything else -> q6qxxx. A mismatch makes every
# ID-attested key fail with CANNOT_ATTEST_IDS.
# The European code list is the EEA table from stock /system/bin/init (BYGB).
# One block per code; the fallback at the end must stay last.

on init && property:ro.boot.carrierid=E49
    setprop ro.product.name_for_attestation q6qxeea

on init && property:ro.boot.carrierid=MOA
    setprop ro.product.name_for_attestation q6qxeea

